I am going to the office soon.
It will rain today.
It will also be very cold.
So I am dressing warmly today.
I take my new sweatshirt out of the closet.
I put the sweatshirt on.
It is grey and very thick.
Then I need my coat.
The coat is dark green and heavy.
I put the coat on.
It is really cold outside.
I also need my hat.
My hat is yellow and very warm.
I put the hat on.
I take my backpack for the laptop.
My umbrella is next to the door.
It is big and very sturdy.
I take the umbrella in my hand.
I am ready for the bad weather.
I open the door and leave the flat.
